\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Auf Papiervorsatzblatt des 18. Jh. von J. H. Jaeck (1777\endash 1847) Inhaltsverzeichnis. \endash  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Guilelmus Durantis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Repertorium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Paulus de Liazariis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Summula}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dinus Mugellanus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Apparatus super regulis juris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Andreae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Commenta (in Decretales)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Calderinus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Repetitiones et Summulae Distinctiones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Laurentius de Polonia, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[5].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Memoriale Decreti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (siehe zum Inhalt auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leitschuh\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Kat.I.1, S. 932\endash 934). Auf 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 als Rubrik Inhaltsangabe des Bandes:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit repertorium aureum domini Gullelmi durantis / Et apparatus domini dyni super titulo de regulis / iuris libro VI\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . / Item commenta domini mei Johannis andree. / excellentissimi doctoris decretorum. / Item repeticiones domini mei Johannis Calder/ini doctoris decretorum Egregii. Item distinctiones / eiusdem domini Johannis Calderini. Item sumula domini pauli / super decreto. / Item commemoriale aureum super decreto / domini laurencii Capellani domini pape.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Zu den einzelnen Texten zahlreiche Annotationen und Kommentare}

