\f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u8222 \'84Properization\ldblquote and Formal Changes in High Medieval Saint\rquote s Offices: The Offices for Saints Henry and Kunigunde of Bamberg, in: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Plainsong and Medieval Music\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 10 (2001), S. 3\endash 21, hier S. 6\endash 9.}

