\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs28 Ps. Albertus Magnus, Biblia Mariana \endash Summa virtutum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Nachtrag, wohl noch 14. Jh.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Es was eine geistliche vrouwe in eime clostere, die was lange in visebette gelegen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\u8230 \'85). \endash 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Hugo Argentinensis, Compendium theologicae veritatis, Tractatus ex summa theologicae veritatis de eucharistia, Beginn, wohl Nachtrag des 15. Jh.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Eucharistia est sacramentum caritatis divine quam nostre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\u8230 \'85) vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Neuhauser\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \endash \plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs24 \u352 \'8a\plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs24 ubari\plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs24 \u269 \'e8 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 2005, S. 42. \endash 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps. Albertus Magnus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Biblia Mariana}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 RB II S. 48f. 1054, Msc.Lit.168 genannt). \endash 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Summa virtutum}}}

