\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Inhalt
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Questiones. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Nepos de Monte Albano}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Libellus fugitivus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Text bricht ab bei [\u8230 \'85] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 extra de rescriptis significante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). \endash  3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 leer. \endash  5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Aegidius de Fuscarariis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Ordo iudiciarius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Summa curialis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Blatt 48 leer. \endash Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge: 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Urkunde}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  aus dem Jahr 1296. 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Vacante ecclesia Argentinensis post mortem dni. Conradi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [de Lichtenberg] (\u8230 \'85) \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs20 anno domini m\plain \f1\i\ul\super\lang1033\fs20 o\plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs20 cc\plain \f1\i\ul\super\lang1033\fs20 o\plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs20 nonag. nono\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash Zu den Texten (Libellus und Ordo iudiciarius) vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Coing 1973\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 390, 393.}

