\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Inhalt
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 488\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Biblia latina}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  nach Pariser Bibelschema (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sauer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kuder \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 1996, S. 207\endash 219). 489\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 527\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : Interpretationes nominum hebraicorum. \endash  Fehlstellen durch Blattverluste zwischen Blatt 62/63, Blatt 124/125, Blatt 245/246, Blatt 458/459 (S284 1\endash 6; Gen 1\endash 4; Dt 1,1; III Reg 1\endash 3; I Par 7,10 \endash II Par 12,8; Prv 1\endash 5; Sap 1\endash 6; Tit 1,4\endash 3; Phlm; Hbr 1\endash 1,7).}

