\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs28\chcbpat18 Bibel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs28  (in 3 B\u228 \'e4nde)
